WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:02.480
<b>Do you...</b>

00:03.100 --> 00:06.690
<b>really think you can just take a gold coin?</b>

00:08.400 --> 00:12.110
<b>From me?
The magma master of Orca dorm...</b>

00:12.570 --> 00:15.360
<b>Rhodes Eamus!</b>

00:21.370 --> 00:25.620
<b>I had heard you were
surprisingly aggressive for an Orca...</b>

00:26.420 --> 00:30.090
<b>But you were nothing more, it seems.</b>

02:19.910 --> 02:23.120
<b>Magically talented, and high self-esteem...</b>

02:23.490 --> 02:29.620
<b>Lang's elite, Magia Lupus,
is filled with students of that nature.</b>

02:30.040 --> 02:33.840
<b>Its higher ranks are clearly
the top students in this school.</b>

02:34.670 --> 02:38.630
<b>I'd rather not play defense
against those with actual skills...</b>

02:39.050 --> 02:43.680
<b>But this school hides
the dorms' locations from each other.</b>

02:43.970 --> 02:47.270
<b>This is to encourage
inter-dorm competition.</b>

02:48.180 --> 02:49.270
<b>That's why...</b>

02:49.890 --> 02:53.650
<b>we're going to figure out where
they are, so we can take their coins.</b>

02:57.610 --> 02:58.650
<b>'Kay.</b>

03:00.450 --> 03:02.910
<b>Were you really listening?</b>

03:04.030 --> 03:07.200
<b>Lastly, it's been a month
since you were admitted.</b>

03:07.200 --> 03:10.000
<b>Here's your dorm robe. Put it on.</b>

03:10.660 --> 03:11.670
<b>'Kay.</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:18.170
<b>You're joking around, right?</b>

03:19.670 --> 03:21.680
<b>Whoa, the logo.</b>

03:21.680 --> 03:24.180
<b>That's not a logo. That's Adler's mark.</b>

03:24.640 --> 03:28.430
<b>And by the way, logos are letters
that have been transformed into a design.</b>

03:28.890 --> 03:29.930
<b>'Kay.</b>

03:29.930 --> 03:34.310
<b>I hope this makes you more conscious
of the fact that you belong to a dorm.</b>

03:34.440 --> 03:35.730
<b>But first...</b>

03:35.730 --> 03:37.150
<b>Mash!</b>

03:37.150 --> 03:39.440
<b>Big trouble! Tom is...</b>

03:39.990 --> 03:43.320
<b>- Can you hold on? My cream puffs...
- But Tom...</b>

03:43.780 --> 03:45.320
<b>No, my cream puffs...</b>

03:45.320 --> 03:47.200
<b>Tom!</b>

03:47.950 --> 03:49.660
<b><i>They went to the infirmary.</i></b>

03:50.540 --> 03:55.290
<b>Hey, guys...
How are you all... bambooing?</b>

03:55.580 --> 03:58.420
<b>Or are you more like bamboo-it?</b>

03:58.420 --> 04:00.670
<b>Captain's character identity...</b>

04:00.670 --> 04:03.720
<b>What happened? You look so drained.</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:08.430
<b>That's the thing. I don't really remember.</b>

04:08.600 --> 04:10.470
<b>When I woke up, I was here.</b>

04:10.980 --> 04:15.480
<b>Usually I live my life at full throttle
so I fall asleep and bam, it's morning.</b>

04:16.190 --> 04:17.940
<b>I don't dream.</b>

04:18.190 --> 04:20.400
<b>But the night I collapsed...</b>

04:20.650 --> 04:26.410
<b>I dreamt that I was trapped
and stuffed in some dark box.</b>

04:27.450 --> 04:31.500
<b>I was fully conscious but couldn't speak.</b>

04:32.200 --> 04:34.870
<b>I was in that state for hours.</b>

04:36.080 --> 04:38.500
<b>It was such a nightmare.</b>

04:38.960 --> 04:40.960
<b>Captain is so shook up.</b>

04:41.460 --> 04:43.630
<b>I need to eat a cream puff.</b>

04:43.630 --> 04:45.760
<b>Mash, please keep it down.</b>

04:46.140 --> 04:49.260
<b>Are you okay physically?</b>

04:49.760 --> 04:52.810
<b>Yeah. I just feel slightly woozy.</b>

04:53.230 --> 04:54.270
<b>Also...</b>

04:54.730 --> 04:57.810
<b>I'm temporarily unable to use magic.</b>

04:58.270 --> 05:01.530
<b>I hardly feel magical energy within me.</b>

05:01.820 --> 05:04.490
<b>It's like someone sucked it out of me...</b>

05:05.490 --> 05:08.780
<b>I see. But in any case...</b>

05:09.330 --> 05:11.450
<b>Why are there so many here?</b>

05:12.750 --> 05:18.540
<b>Yeah. They all seem to have lost
their magic temporarily, too.</b>

05:18.790 --> 05:23.380
<b>Right when our headmaster
got called out to the Bureau of Magic...</b>

05:24.800 --> 05:27.930
<b>Um, Mash. Take this.</b>

05:29.350 --> 05:31.060
<b>HONK</b>

05:31.810 --> 05:33.060
<b>What's this?</b>

05:33.060 --> 05:36.560
<b>That's Creamy.
She's a good luck charm I made.</b>

05:37.100 --> 05:40.310
<b>I've been feeling a little anxious lately.</b>

05:41.020 --> 05:42.070
<b>What's with the ribbon?</b>

05:43.070 --> 05:44.570
<b>You're so tactless!</b>

05:47.950 --> 05:51.580
<b>In any case,
don't do anything too risky, all right?</b>

05:52.490 --> 05:53.450
<b>Okay.</b>

05:54.160 --> 05:59.830
<b>And keep that with you at all times,
and always think of me!</b>

06:00.290 --> 06:01.750
<b>S-Sure.</b>

06:01.750 --> 06:03.050
<b>You absolutely have to!</b>

06:03.050 --> 06:06.590
<b>And when you sleep, hold onto it
so that in your dreams, I can...</b>

06:08.300 --> 06:10.760
<b>You beast!</b>

06:11.220 --> 06:15.470
<b><i>Late night, after lights out in the dorm...</i></b>

06:16.640 --> 06:21.730
<b>I'm sure the Magia Lupus are behind
these events. What I think is—</b>

06:21.730 --> 06:26.400
<b>Should we really be walking
around school after hours?</b>

06:26.940 --> 06:29.860
<b>You really are a straight arrow, aren't you.</b>

06:30.070 --> 06:32.370
<b>It'll be fine if we apologize later!</b>

06:32.370 --> 06:34.740
<b>Don't leave me alone!</b>

06:35.240 --> 06:37.750
<b>Why are you guys tagging along?</b>

06:37.790 --> 06:44.380
<b>HEAVE-HO!</b>

06:39.040 --> 06:41.830
<b>Cause I want coins too, moron!</b>

06:41.830 --> 06:44.380
<b>Don't leave me all alone in that room!</b>

06:45.050 --> 06:48.380
<b>I feel bad for them.
Let's take them with us.</b>

06:45.050 --> 06:48.380
<b>- Huh? Are you really gonna do it?
- I'm so scared!</b>

06:49.880 --> 06:51.470
<b><i>I'm not sure about this.</i></b>

06:55.260 --> 06:56.140
<b>Hey! See that!?</b>

06:58.310 --> 07:04.020
<b>BLOOSH</b>

06:59.190 --> 07:00.560
<b>It's Lemon.</b>

07:00.560 --> 07:03.110
<b>She looks so cute from behind, too.</b>

07:04.690 --> 07:07.190
<b>Hey, Lemo...</b>

07:07.990 --> 07:09.110
<b>Wait.</b>

07:09.280 --> 07:10.700
<b>Something's wrong.</b>

07:39.270 --> 07:41.560
<b>Hey, you've gotta be kidding me.</b>

07:41.690 --> 07:49.570
<b>BLOOSH</b>

07:42.190 --> 07:45.560
<b>She didn't have any eyes, but she was
so cute because it was Lemon.</b>

07:45.560 --> 07:48.070
<b>I just realized that.</b>

07:49.940 --> 07:52.320
<b>That's definitely magic all right.</b>

07:52.450 --> 07:53.950
<b>- What should we—
- Wait.</b>

07:54.450 --> 07:56.660
<b>She's going somewhere.</b>

07:56.740 --> 07:57.870
<b>We gotta chase her.</b>

08:00.910 --> 08:03.210
<b>She turned that corner.</b>

08:07.550 --> 08:08.750
<b>She's gone.</b>

08:09.460 --> 08:12.380
<b>You're kidding, right?
This is a dead end.</b>

08:14.220 --> 08:16.970
<b>Hey. Did you hear something?</b>

08:16.970 --> 08:19.350
<b>Huh? I didn't hear anything.</b>

08:23.190 --> 08:24.730
<b>No, I do hear something.</b>

08:24.730 --> 08:26.480
<b>Like the sound of wood creaking!</b>

08:26.770 --> 08:28.480
<b>Don't be spouting random bull...</b>

08:30.440 --> 08:32.610
<b>I heard it too. Just kill me now!</b>

08:32.990 --> 08:33.950
<b>Lemon!</b>

08:35.490 --> 08:37.990
<b>Stay calm. It's just a spell.</b>

08:38.700 --> 08:39.990
<b>Disclose.</b>

08:47.380 --> 08:49.000
<b>What the hell?</b>

08:49.000 --> 08:50.630
<b>A d-door?</b>

08:55.470 --> 08:59.850
<b>Revealing the door
is as far as my magic can go.</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:03.770
<b>So we need another special spell to open it.</b>

09:04.060 --> 09:06.020
<b>Machine Gun Explomb!</b>

09:11.280 --> 09:13.440
<b>Damn thing won't budge!!</b>

09:13.440 --> 09:15.610
<b>What the hell are we supposed to do with it?</b>

09:25.500 --> 09:27.080
<b>H-Hey.</b>

09:27.080 --> 09:28.460
<b>Mash?</b>

09:51.270 --> 09:54.280
<b>He pried the door open
with the power of leverage.</b>

09:54.860 --> 09:57.490
<b>Anything goes for him, huh?</b>

09:59.660 --> 10:03.290
<b>Lemon is inside. And most likely...</b>

10:03.870 --> 10:05.620
<b>the Magia Lupus, too.</b>

10:11.040 --> 10:13.420
<b><i>Don't do anything too risky, all right?</i></b>

10:15.920 --> 10:17.220
<b>I'm sorry, but...</b>

10:17.880 --> 10:20.720
<b>I don't think
I'll be able to keep that promise.</b>

10:22.680 --> 10:23.600
<b>Let's go.</b>

10:30.100 --> 10:32.310
<b>I had no idea the school
had a lower level like this.</b>

10:33.070 --> 10:35.530
<b>It's like a secret base. Right, Finn?</b>

10:35.530 --> 10:37.030
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

10:37.030 --> 10:40.530
<b>You punk! Keep killing
the dramatic tension and I'll kill ya!</b>

10:40.530 --> 10:43.330
<b>FLUMP</b>

10:40.820 --> 10:42.160
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

10:42.160 --> 10:44.830
<b>I mean, I wouldn't really... Wait...</b>

10:44.830 --> 10:46.290
<b>Look, I'm sorry too, man.</b>

10:46.290 --> 10:48.330
<b>Mash, don't be so depressed.</b>

10:49.710 --> 10:51.960
<b>Our enemies chose this place as their hideout.</b>

10:52.290 --> 10:56.010
<b>I'm certain this location
gives them an advantage.</b>

10:58.880 --> 11:00.010
<b>Hey, see that?</b>

11:00.010 --> 11:01.340
<b>There's light over there!</b>

11:08.810 --> 11:10.350
<b>An arena?</b>

11:11.310 --> 11:12.650
<b>What is this?</b>

11:12.650 --> 11:15.110
<b>Are you a little slow?</b>

11:15.360 --> 11:16.610
<b>Correct!</b>

11:20.360 --> 11:23.120
<b>It's an ancient dueling field.</b>

11:23.370 --> 11:26.450
<b>So old that current teachers
don't even know it exists.</b>

11:27.200 --> 11:29.910
<b>Are you one of the Magia Lupus?</b>

11:30.370 --> 11:32.630
<b>Me? No, no.</b>

11:32.630 --> 11:35.460
<b>I'm here at Third Fang's request.</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:41.130
<b>To eradicate intruders like you.</b>

11:43.010 --> 11:47.890
<b>Now, if you want to proceed,
you need to wager coins and challenge me.</b>

11:48.100 --> 11:49.140
<b>Though...</b>

11:49.520 --> 11:51.640
<b>I'll never let you get through!</b>

11:52.650 --> 11:54.060
<b>Very well.</b>

11:54.400 --> 11:55.400
<b>Wait.</b>

11:55.900 --> 11:57.110
<b>Let me.</b>

11:57.480 --> 11:58.400
<b>Dot.</b>

11:58.940 --> 12:04.110
<b>'Cause you know that I hate
good-lookin' guys to death.</b>

12:05.910 --> 12:07.120
<b>I see.</b>

12:07.120 --> 12:08.450
<b>Go get 'im.</b>

12:08.450 --> 12:09.790
<b>Good luck.</b>

12:12.120 --> 12:14.170
<b>Hey, you know what?</b>

12:15.170 --> 12:17.670
<b>You have a fan club, don't you?</b>

12:17.920 --> 12:19.800
<b>I do. What of it?</b>

12:21.090 --> 12:22.800
<b>Jealous rant incoming.</b>

12:23.050 --> 12:24.640
<b>Most definitely so.</b>

12:24.840 --> 12:26.050
<b>Very likely.</b>

12:26.890 --> 12:30.310
<b>Livin' the dream, are ya!? I'll kill ya!</b>

12:31.560 --> 12:32.770
<b>As expected...</b>

12:32.770 --> 12:35.230
<b>You could say his jealousy
is even invigorating.</b>

12:35.230 --> 12:37.440
<b>What a pitiful creature.</b>

12:37.650 --> 12:40.320
<b>What? You're jealous of my attractiveness?</b>

12:40.400 --> 12:42.070
<b>I am, so what!?</b>

12:40.400 --> 12:42.070
<b>RAH</b>

12:42.570 --> 12:44.910
<b>You can be jealous and all that.</b>

12:45.110 --> 12:50.410
<b>Well, since you lack both a good face
and good brains, I don't see how I could lose.</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:52.750
<b>Rose Whip.</b>

12:59.380 --> 13:01.840
<b><i>Though they came here to rescue Lemon,</i></b>

13:02.010 --> 13:08.680
<b><i>the ugly battle of Dot Barrett, envious
of a handsome boy, was about to begin.</i></b>

13:11.470 --> 13:15.940
<b><i>This is the Bureau of Magic,
the Magic Realm's highest legal authority.</i></b>

13:16.770 --> 13:20.230
<b>Mr. Wahlberg.
I apologize for the sudden call.</b>

13:20.230 --> 13:22.690
<b>No need for apologies.</b>

13:22.690 --> 13:26.240
<b>But the fact that you called for me means...</b>

13:26.780 --> 13:27.740
<b>That's right.</b>

13:28.320 --> 13:33.370
<b>Six of death row's most notorious inmates
have escaped from Hecatrice.</b>

13:33.870 --> 13:37.080
<b>The prison guards were slaughtered.</b>

13:37.170 --> 13:39.380
<b>And they were assisted by...</b>

13:41.380 --> 13:43.800
<b>Innocent Zero.</b>

13:46.680 --> 13:51.680
<b><i>Meanwhile, in the underground arena,
Dot was jealous of the handsome guy.</i></b>

13:51.890 --> 13:52.930
<b>Eat this!</b>

13:53.060 --> 13:54.640
<b>Explomb!</b>

14:04.240 --> 14:07.360
<b>You guys beat Silva
the second-year, didn't you?</b>

14:11.080 --> 14:14.870
<b>A-Actually he maybe kinda
beat the crap outta me.</b>

14:15.160 --> 14:19.380
<b>It's a shame a guy like him
is a double-liner.</b>

14:20.290 --> 14:24.420
<b>But magic capacity is worthless
if you don't use it right.</b>

14:25.050 --> 14:27.130
<b>I'll say this outright.</b>

14:27.590 --> 14:30.470
<b>I'm a lot tougher than he is.</b>

14:31.470 --> 14:32.890
<b>Oh?</b>

14:33.310 --> 14:36.100
<b>Well, I'm definitely not gonna lose.</b>

14:37.560 --> 14:39.270
<b>How do you intend on winning?</b>

14:39.650 --> 14:41.230
<b>Like this!</b>

14:41.900 --> 14:43.770
<b>Explombomb!</b>

14:52.240 --> 14:53.620
<b><i>What are these?</i></b>

14:54.200 --> 14:55.740
<b>Marks on the ground?</b>

14:56.080 --> 14:58.620
<b>Hey, might wanna watch your step!</b>

14:59.040 --> 15:01.210
<b>This is a conditional spell.</b>

15:01.420 --> 15:04.420
<b>It's got five times
the explosive power than usual!</b>

15:05.130 --> 15:08.760
<b>There's no way I would fall
for such an obvious trap.</b>

15:08.760 --> 15:09.880
<b>Not me.</b>

15:10.800 --> 15:11.970
<b>Nah.</b>

15:12.340 --> 15:16.310
<b>A guy like you is sure to fall for it!</b>

15:20.640 --> 15:23.730
<b><i>How does he intend on making me
step on these marks?</i></b>

15:24.270 --> 15:27.480
<b><i>Is there a way to move me from this spot?</i></b>

15:28.530 --> 15:30.860
<b>I won't fall for that trick.</b>

15:31.070 --> 15:33.320
<b>Rose Whip Absol.</b>

15:35.490 --> 15:38.000
<b>Machine Gun Explomb!</b>

15:39.790 --> 15:41.620
<b>Damn it, it's not working!</b>

15:42.790 --> 15:43.960
<b>Grab.</b>

15:47.760 --> 15:48.840
<b>My wand!</b>

15:50.170 --> 15:51.430
<b>Stab.</b>

15:53.840 --> 15:55.760
<b>That hurts!</b>

15:56.720 --> 16:00.350
<b>Those thorns have completely
immobilized your body.</b>

16:01.520 --> 16:04.560
<b>That tacky bandanna with those goofy eyes?</b>

16:04.560 --> 16:07.860
<b>And lacking sense in magic to boot.</b>

16:08.440 --> 16:12.530
<b>You ultimately failed in making me
step on these marks, too.</b>

16:13.610 --> 16:16.620
<b>You really are a far cry from handsome.</b>

16:17.450 --> 16:20.370
<b>My next attack will definitely finish you off.</b>

16:20.660 --> 16:22.790
<b>Stop it!</b>

16:22.790 --> 16:23.620
<b>Drop.</b>

16:27.040 --> 16:30.380
<b>I never said anything about
making you step on the marks.</b>

16:37.890 --> 16:41.350
<b>Explombomb is nothing more
than a time bomb.</b>

16:42.690 --> 16:49.150
<b>Didn't think I'd confidently set time bombs
right in front of your face, did ya?</b>

16:52.820 --> 16:54.660
<b>I'll kill ya eightfold!</b>

16:56.780 --> 16:59.450
<b><i>H-How can I, to someone like him...</i></b>

17:05.500 --> 17:10.960
<b>Don't judge everything
by their looks, pretty boy!</b>

17:11.170 --> 17:12.630
<b>You did it, Dot!</b>

17:13.130 --> 17:15.550
<b>There's no way I'd lose!</b>

17:15.800 --> 17:18.350
<b>Yeah! Bring on the next guy!</b>

17:28.110 --> 17:31.610
<b><i>This punk. Striking an attractive pose,
even in defeat...</i></b>

17:32.400 --> 17:34.320
<b><i>He sure is unwavering.</i></b>

17:35.360 --> 17:37.950
<b><i>I don't exactly hate that.</i></b>

17:38.280 --> 17:39.580
<b>Is it over?</b>

17:41.040 --> 17:42.830
<b>Wh-What the hell!?</b>

17:43.410 --> 17:45.330
<b>I'm getting sucked into the ground.</b>

17:45.540 --> 17:48.580
<b>Please, save my baby.
At least spare this one.</b>

17:49.080 --> 17:52.880
<b>I assume this means our enemies
have no intention of letting us g...</b>

17:53.710 --> 17:56.630
<b>I'm sinking! I'm going to sink!</b>

17:58.510 --> 17:59.970
<b><i>I think these guys...</i></b>

18:00.600 --> 18:02.220
<b><i>are even more insane than I am?</i></b>

18:18.660 --> 18:21.950
<b>Their plan is to split us up
and hunt us down.</b>

18:25.910 --> 18:27.960
<b>The double-liner first-year...</b>

18:30.960 --> 18:34.920
<b>I was more interested
in seeing Mushroom Head.</b>

18:35.670 --> 18:37.880
<b><i>That magic earlier was his, huh?</i></b>

18:38.180 --> 18:41.640
<b><i>So this is the upper echelon
of Magia Lupus.</i></b>

18:41.720 --> 18:44.350
<b>The first-year double-liner, huh?</b>

18:46.730 --> 18:49.730
<b>Being scummy is totally inexcusable, okay?</b>

18:51.940 --> 18:56.400
<b>I am the Third Fang
of Magia Lupus, Wirth Madl.</b>

18:56.400 --> 18:58.490
<b>THIRD FANG: WIRTH MADL</b>

18:58.860 --> 19:05.450
<b>Being worthlessly weak
is absolutely inexcusable. Got that?</b>

19:10.620 --> 19:12.840
<b>Ow.</b>

19:18.970 --> 19:24.010
<b>Two single-liners? Easy-peasy! Hurray!</b>

19:24.350 --> 19:27.770
<b>I'm the Fifth Fang
of Magia Lupus, Love Cute!</b>

19:27.930 --> 19:29.890
<b>FIFTH FANG: LOVE CUTE</b>

19:30.230 --> 19:33.520
<b>And I'm the Fourth Fang, Milo Genius.</b>

19:33.690 --> 19:35.650
<b>FOURTH FANG: MILO GENIUS</b>

19:36.070 --> 19:40.030
<b>T-Two double-liners. We're done for.</b>

19:40.610 --> 19:45.450
<b>Thank you for bringing me into this world,
Dad and Mom. I'm sorry.</b>

19:45.450 --> 19:46.830
<b>Goodbye.</b>

19:46.830 --> 19:47.790
<b>Hey.</b>

19:48.620 --> 19:51.000
<b>Don't give up before we've even started.</b>

19:51.000 --> 19:53.290
<b>It's a super underdog victory
if we can get through this.</b>

19:55.420 --> 20:00.090
<b>I'll show you the power
of the protagonist, you side characters.</b>

20:01.050 --> 20:05.260
<b>Wow, so cool!
You really sound like a main character!</b>

20:07.930 --> 20:08.890
<b>Ouchies.</b>

20:12.730 --> 20:13.690
<b>Huh?</b>

20:14.100 --> 20:15.480
<b>Where is everyone?</b>

20:15.730 --> 20:18.570
<b>Did you get separated from your friends?</b>

20:24.200 --> 20:25.530
<b>You're from that other day...</b>

20:26.160 --> 20:27.870
<b>It has been a while.</b>

20:27.990 --> 20:31.210
<b>Come to think,
I had not introduced myself yet.</b>

20:31.660 --> 20:36.460
<b>I am the Second Fang
of Magia Lupus, Abyss Razor.</b>

20:36.590 --> 20:38.710
<b>SECOND FANG: ABYSS RAZOR</b>

20:39.170 --> 20:40.920
<b>I hope you will remember me.</b>

20:40.920 --> 20:43.050
<b>Oh. Yes, thank you.</b>

20:43.680 --> 20:46.720
<b>How you moved about the other day...</b>

20:52.850 --> 20:55.190
<b>It was quite impressive.</b>

20:55.980 --> 20:58.230
<b>Oh, um, thanks.</b>

20:58.230 --> 21:00.400
<b>I noticed it back then.</b>

21:00.860 --> 21:04.570
<b>You're unable to use magic, aren't you?</b>

21:05.780 --> 21:06.660
<b>Huh?</b>

21:07.160 --> 21:11.040
<b>Th-Th-That's not necessarily t-t-true.</b>

21:13.500 --> 21:15.420
<b>You seem a little agitated.</b>

21:15.540 --> 21:18.590
<b>Wh-What makes you th-think that?</b>

21:19.550 --> 21:21.050
<b>I'm not.</b>

21:21.420 --> 21:23.800
<b>You don't have to worry.</b>

21:24.130 --> 21:26.050
<b>Just like you,</b>

21:26.640 --> 21:29.050
<b>I am someone abhorred by this world.</b>

21:31.970 --> 21:34.940
<b>You must have your reasons for being here.</b>

21:37.190 --> 21:41.320
<b>But I, too, have my reasons.</b>

21:42.320 --> 21:48.070
<b>Huh? You sound like
you're planning to defeat me.</b>

21:48.990 --> 21:50.870
<b>I'll beat the stuffing out of you.</b>

21:52.290 --> 21:53.700
<b>With all I've got.</b>

21:55.120 --> 21:57.120
<b><i>In order to rescue Lemon,</i></b>

21:57.120 --> 22:03.710
<b><i>Mash and company's battle against
the Magia Lupus was about to begin.</i></b>

23:35.260 --> 23:39.980
<b>NEXT EPISODE
MASH BURNEDEAD AND THE ACCELERATED BATTLE</b>
